{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"Larger epilogue tiles reduce the 8192-token path from about 2.68 ms to 2.42 ms in local timing; parallel GEMM streams add synchronization overhead and are not useful. I’m keeping the larger exact tile and prototyping the final high-upside option: one kernel that computes both matrix products and applies GELU before either accumulator reaches HBM."}}
